data: {"id": "6483daf5b55a4244-final", "run_id": "6483daf5b55a4244", "seq": 2468, "ts_ms": 1789375656218, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v14/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: \"failed to setup network for sandbox... plugin type=\\\"multus\\\" name=\\\"multus-cni-network\\\"... error adding container to network \\\"secondary-net\\\": failed to find plugin \\\"aiops-unavailable\\\" in path [/opt/cni/bin /opt/cni/bin]\" | 直接失败现象，明确缺失插件名及路径 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `ContainerCreating` / `Pending`，`ContainersReady` 状态为 `False` | 描述 Pod 当前停滞的阻塞状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Pod 配置 `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: secondary-net` | 指示 Pod 请求了名为 `secondary-net` 的附加网络 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1` (`reason: ContainerCreating`) | 从监控时序数据确认 Pod 处于等待创建容器的状态 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 事件 (#1) 揭示了 `multus` 调用 `secondary-net` 附加网络时，在宿主机路径 `/opt/cni/bin` 下未能找到名为 `aiops-unavailable` 的插件二进制文件。这一底层网络配置缺失直接导致 SandBox 创建失败，进而表现为 Pod 状态 (#2) 长期卡在 `ContainerCreating`。监控数据 (#4) 的时序观测与这一即时故障原因相互印证，证实了阻塞发生在容器初始化前的网络准备阶段。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nMultus 网络配置引用不存在的 CNI 插件 'aiops-unavailable' → 节点 CNI 运行时插件缺失 → 网络初始化失败 (SandBox 创建报错) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod 使用的 Multus 附加网络配置（`secondary-net`）引用了名为 `aiops-unavailable` 的 CNI 插件，但目标节点（node2）的 `/opt/cni/bin` 目录下缺失该插件的二进制文件。\n\n该缺失直接导致 kubelet 在执行 Pod SandBox 创建时无法完成网络附加步骤，从而抛出 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误。这一机制导致容器无法启动，表现为 Pod 永久处于 `ContainerCreating` 状态，且重启计数为 0（无应用逻辑运行）。证据 #1 中的报错原文与证据 #3 中的网络注解构成了完整的因果闭环。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 10.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 592.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v14/workload: 592.5s (Evidence 584.7s, RCA 7.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v14/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 618.735, "metrics": {"run_id": "6483daf5b55a4244", "mttr": {"value": "10.3m", "seconds": 618.7437334060669, "pass": false, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 618743.7334060669, "llm_calls": 21, "llm_duration_ms": 611551.3560771942, "tool_calls": 23, "executed_tool_calls": 17, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 22, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 14788.626432418823, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6682.2569370269775}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name